</code></pre>
</li>
<li>
<p>Ensure that <a href="https://go.dev/doc/install"><code>go</code></a> and <code>pandoc</code> (at least version
) are installed (more info
).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><code>cd</code> to the <code>test/site/</code> directory and do:</p>
